e opposing party&#039;s policies. <em>(burkolt \/ nem egy\u00e9rtelm\u0171)<\/em><\/p><p>The research identified a _______ correlation between the two variables, requiring further investigation. <em>(apr\u00f3 \/ nem nyilv\u00e1nval\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p>She wore a dress with a _______ pattern of tiny flowers, almost imperceptible at first glance. <em>(apr\u00f3 \/ diszkr\u00e9t)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">finom \/ enyhe \/ burkolt \/ apr\u00f3 \/ diszkr\u00e9t<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): nyilv\u00e1nval\u00f3 \/ felt\u0171n\u0151 \/ er\u0151s<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ difference = finom k\u00fcl\u00f6nbs\u00e9g (pl. There&#039;s a subtle difference between these two shades of blue.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ hint = finom utal\u00e1s (pl. He gave a subtle hint that he wanted to leave.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ change = enyhe v\u00e1ltoz\u00e1s (pl. We noticed a subtle change in his behavior.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ criticism = burkolt kritika (pl. Her review contained subtle criticism of the author&#039;s style.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>subtle<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>subtle<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>subtly<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>subtlety<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: subtle difference \/ subtle hint \/ subtle change \/ subtle way<\/span><\/p><p>similar: delicate \/ fine \/ nuanced \/ understated<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: obvious \/ apparent \/ blatant<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"subtle\nsubtly","study_direction":"back_to_front","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"learning","interval":0,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"15 perc","good":"1 nap","easy":"4 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T17:44:59+00:00"},{"id":51161,"front":"