 van valaki\/valami ellen (pl. She felt the teacher had a _______ against her because of her accent.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 unconscious _______ = tudattalan elfogults\u00e1g (pl. Many hiring managers struggle with unconscious _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 eliminate _______ = elfogults\u00e1got megsz\u00fcntetni (pl. The company is working to eliminate _______ in its marketing campaigns.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 political _______ = politikai elfogults\u00e1g (pl. The article was criticized for its obvious political _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: bias<\/p><p>verb: bias<\/p><p>common pair: show bias \/ have a bias against \/ unconscious bias \/ eliminate bias<\/p><p>similar: prejudice \/ partiality \/ favoritism \/ leaning<\/p><p>negative: impartiality \/ objectivity \/ fairness<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-07T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":49593,"front":"<p>He felt guilty about his _______ thoughts during the sermon. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ erk\u00f6lcstelen)<\/em><\/p><p>The novel explored the _______ desires that led to the protagonist&#039;s downfall. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ erk\u00f6lcstelen \/ romlott)<\/em><\/p><p>Many religious traditions condemn _______ acts as a violation of divine law. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ istentelen \/ erk\u00f6lcstelen)<\/em><\/p><p>The detective suspected a _______ motive behind the seemingly random crime. <em>(rosszindulat\u00fa \/ gonosz \/ b\u0171n\u00f6s)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ erk\u00f6lcstelen \/ gonosz \/ istentelen \/ rosszindulat\u00fa<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): er\u00e9nyes \/ j\u00e1mbor \/ szent<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 T