edgy \/ ennek k\u00f6vetkezt\u00e9ben \/ ennek r\u00e9v\u00e9n \/ enn\u00e9lfogva<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): megakad\u00e1lyozva \/ nem el\u0151id\u00e9zve \/ ellenkez\u0151leg<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ improving = ez\u00e1ltal jav\u00edtva (pl. He studied diligently, thereby improving his grades.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ increasing = ez\u00e1ltal n\u00f6velve (pl. The new policy was implemented, thereby increasing profits.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ causing = ez\u00e1ltal okozva (pl. The accident was caused by negligence, thereby causing significant damage.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ leading to = ez\u00e1ltal vezetve ahhoz (pl. The experiment was a success, thereby leading to a breakthrough.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>thereby<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: thereby increasing \/ thereby improving \/ thereby causing \/ thereby leading<\/span><\/p><p>similar: thus \/ hence \/ therefore \/ consequently<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: preventing \/ hindering \/ obstructing<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-08T17:26:53+00:00"},{"id":51173,"front":"<p>She ________ed tomatoes and herbs in the garden every spring. (\u00fcltet \/ el\u00fcltet)<\/p><p>The factory ________ was shut down due to safety violations. (\u00fczem \/ gy\u00e1r)<\/p><p>Someone had ________ed a listening device in the office. (elhelyez \/ elrejt)<\/p><p>He ________ed a kiss on her cheek and said goodbye. (nyom \/ elhelyez)<\/p><p>\u00fcltet \/ \u00fczem \/ gy\u00e1r \/ elhelyez \/ elrejt<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): kiszed \/ kiv\u00e1g \/ bez\u00e1r (gy\u00e1rat)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = n\u00f6v\u00e9ny \/ gy\u00e1r, \u00fczem<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (verb) = el\u00fcltet \/ elhelyez \/ elrejt (titkosan)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ an idea = gondolatot \u00fcltet valakibe<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ evidence = bizony\u00edt\u00e9kot hamis\u00edt \/ elhelyez<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 power ________ = er\u0151m\u0171<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: plant<\/p><p>verb: plant<\/p><p>past tense \/ -ing form: planted \/ planting<\/p><p>common pair: plant a tree \/ power plant \/ plant evidence \/ plant an idea \/ factory plant<\/p><p>similar: shrub \/ factory \/ place \/ embed \/ sow<\/p><p>negative: uproot \/ demolish \/ close down \/ remove<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":51165,"front":"<p>Risk is ________ in this kind of work. (benne rejl\u0151 \/ velej\u00e1r\u00f3)<\/p><p>There are ________ problems in the system. (eredend\u0151 \/ bels\u0151)<\/p><p>Violence is not ________ in human nature. (vele sz\u00fcletett \/ eredend\u0151)<\/p><p>This flaw is ________ in the design. (benne rejl\u0151)<\/p><p>velej\u00e1r\u00f3 \/ benne rejl\u0151 \/ eredend\u0151<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU)k\u00fcls\u0151 \/ megszerzett<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ___ in something = benne rejl\u0151 valamiben\ud83d\udc49 inherent risk \/ problem \/ flaw\ud83d\udc49 gyakran absztrakt dolgokn\u00e1l haszn\u00e1ljuk\ud83d\udc49 form\u00e1lis sz\u00f3 (C1 szint)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>adjective: inherent<\/p><p>structure: inherent in<\/p><p>negative: external \/ acquired<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T21:09:27+00:00"},{"id":51218,"front":"<p>The board is likely to _______ the new proposal due to budget cuts. (helytelen\u00edt \/ elutas\u00edt)<\/p><p>My parents _______ of my decision to quit my stable job. (nem helyesel \/ rosszal)<\/p><p>The committee will _______ any application that doesn&#039;t meet the criteria. (nem hagy j\u00f3v\u00e1 \/ elutas\u00edt)<\/p><p>helytelen\u00edt \/ rosszal \/ nem hagy j\u00f3v\u00e1 \/ elutas\u00edt<\/p><p>Negative meaning  <\/p><p>(HU): helyesel \/ t\u00e1mogat \/ j\u00f3v\u00e1hagy\ud83d\udd11<\/p><p> Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of something = rosszal valamit (Vonzat! Pl. She strongly _______ of smoking.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 official _______ = hivatalos elutas\u00edt\u00e1s (Pl. The plan was _______ed by the council.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>verb: disapprove<\/p><p>common pair: strongly disapprove \/ disapprove of a choice \/ disapprove of a behavior<\/p><p>similar: reject \/ condemn \/ frown upon \/ object<\/p><p>negative: approve \/ endorse \/ support \/ authorize<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-09T20:41:07+00:00"},{"id":51217,"front":"<p>He gave her a knowing _______ as he passed the secret note. (kacsint\u00e1s \/ biccent\u00e9s)<\/p><p>She tried to _______ at him to get his attention across the crowded room. (kacsintani \/ jelezni)<\/p><p>The magician performed a quick _______ of the eye, making the coin disappear. (kacsint\u00e1s \/ tr\u00fckk)<\/p><p>Don&#039;t take everything he says so seriously; he&#039;s often just _______. (viccel \/ po\u00e9nkodik)<\/p><p>kacsint\u00e1s \/ biccent\u00e9s \/ jelz\u00e9s \/ mosoly \/ szemrebben\u00e9s<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): komolyan v\u00e9tel \/ szigor\u00fa tekintet \/ figyelmen k\u00edv\u00fcl hagy\u00e1s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ at someone = kacsintani valakire (pl. He winked at me from across the bar.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 a knowing _______ = tud\u00f3, titkos kacsint\u00e1s (pl. She gave him a knowing wink.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ and _______ = kacsintani \u00e9s mosolyogni (gyakran viccel\u0151dve) (pl. He winked and grinned.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 to _______ a secret = titokban kacsintani (pl. They winked a secret message to each other.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: wink<\/p><p>verb: wink<\/p><p>common pair: wink and smile \/ wink at \/ a wink of \/ wink of an eye<\/p><p>similar: blink \/ signal \/ nod \/ gesture<\/p><p>negative: stare \/ frown \/ glare<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"7 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-07T00:00:00+00:00"},{"id":51225,"front":"<p>She strung a colorful _______ on the thread to make a necklace. (gy\u00f6ngy \/ k\u00e1saszer\u0171 apr\u00f3 t\u00e1rgy)<\/p><p>The company aims to _______ the cost of production by streamlining its processes. (cs\u00f6kkent \/ m\u00e9rs\u00e9kel)<\/p><p>The microscopic analysis revealed a _______ of protein molecules clustered together. (halmaz \/ csom\u00f3 \/ gy\u0171jtem\u00e9ny)<\/p><p>Dewdrops clung to the spiderweb like tiny, glistening _______. (cseppek \/ kisebb g\u00f6mb\u00f6csk\u00e9k)<\/p><p>gy\u00f6ngy \/ csepp \/ szem \/ k\u00e1sa \/ halmaz<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): n\u00f6vel \/ szapor\u00edt \/ sz\u00f3r<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 string _______ together = \u00f6sszef\u0171z gy\u00f6ngy\u00f6ket (pl. She likes to string beads together to make bracelets.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of _______ = valaminek a gy\u00f6ngyei\/szemei (pl. a bead of sweat)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ the cost = cs\u00f6kkenteni a k\u00f6lts\u00e9get (pl. We need to bead the expenses.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of _______ = valaminek a halmaza\/csoportja (pl. a bead of cells)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>bead<\/p><p>noun: bead<\/p><p>verb: bead<\/p><p>common pair: glass bead \/ wooden bead \/ bead of sweat \/ bead necklace<\/p><p>similar: pearl \/ globule \/ droplet \/ pellet<\/p><p>negative: increase \/ expand \/ disperse<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"7 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-07T20:29:43+00:00"},{"id":49596,"front":"<p>He looked down, feeling _______ for breaking the vase. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ rosszul \u00e9rzi mag\u00e1t)<\/em><\/p><p>The jury found the defendant _______ of all charges. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ \u00edt\u00e9lve)<\/em><\/p><p>Despite his outward confidence, he harbored a deep sense of _______ about his past actions. <em>(b\u0171ntudat \/ lelkiismeret-furdal\u00e1s)<\/em><\/p><p>The novel explores the psychological burden of a character who is _______ for a crime he did not commit. <em>(b\u0171n\u00f6snek tartott \/ v\u00e1dolt)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">b\u0171n\u00f6s \/ v\u00e9tkes \/ b\u0171ntudatos \/ lelkiismeret-furdal\u00e1sos \/ felel\u0151s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): \u00e1rtatlan \/ igaz \/ felmentett<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ conscience = b\u0171ntudat (pl. He had a _______ conscience after lying to his parents.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 feel _______ = b\u0171n\u00f6snek \u00e9rzi mag\u00e1t (pl. She felt _______ for eating the last cookie.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ of guilt = b\u0171n\u00f6snek \u00e9rzi mag\u00e1t (pl. He was _______ of guilt, unable to look anyone in the eye.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ verdict = b\u0171n\u00f6s \u00edt\u00e9let (pl. The jury delivered a _______ verdict after hours of deliberation.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>guilty<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>guilty<\/strong><\/p><p>adverb: <strong>guiltily<\/strong><\/p><p>noun: <strong>guilt<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: guilty conscience \/ guilty plea \/ guilty verdict \/ feel guilty<\/span><\/p><p>similar: culpable \/ blameworthy \/ remorseful \/ ashamed<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: innocent \/ blameless \/ guiltless<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-12T20:57:31+00:00"},{"id":51253,"front":"<p>The children were playing with _______ toys made of wood. <em>(egyszer\u0171 \/ alapvet\u0151)<\/em><\/p><p>The company&#039;s initial business plan was quite _______, lacking many details. <em>(v\u00e1zlatos \/ nem kidolgozott)<\/em><\/p><p>The archaeological dig uncovered _______ tools, suggesting a very early stage of human development. <em>(kezdetleges \/ primit\u00edv)<\/em><\/p><p>His understanding of quantum physics was _______; he had only read the introductory chapter. <em>(fel\u00fcletes \/ alapfok\u00fa)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">alapvet\u0151 \/ kezdetleges \/ egyszer\u0171 \/ v\u00e1zlatos \/ primit\u00edv<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): fejlett \/ kidolgozott \/ komplex<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ knowledge = alapvet\u0151 tud\u00e1s (pl. He has only _______ knowledge of the subject.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ understanding = alapvet\u0151 meg\u00e9rt\u00e9s (pl. Her _______ understanding of the problem was a good start.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ skills = alapvet\u0151 k\u00e9szs\u00e9gek (pl. The training focused on teaching _______ skills.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 _______ stage = kezdeti szakasz (pl. The project is still in its _______ stage.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p><strong>rudimentary<\/strong><\/p><p>adjective: <strong>rudimentary<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: rudimentary knowledge \/ rudimentary understanding \/ rudimentary skills \/ rudimentary stage<\/span><\/p><p>similar: basic \/ elementary \/ primitive \/ fundamental<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: advanced \/ sophisticated \/ complex<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":"rudimentary","study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"relearning","interval":1,"lapses":1,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc","hard":"2 perc","good":"10 perc","easy":"1 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-05T20:53:24+00:00"},{"id":49577,"front":"<p>The judge was accused of having a _______ against the defendant. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ el\u0151\u00edt\u00e9let)<\/em><\/p><p>It&#039;s important to be aware of your own _______ when interpreting data. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ szeml\u00e9letm\u00f3d)<\/em><\/p><p>The news report seemed to have a political _______. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ ir\u00e1nyults\u00e1g)<\/em><\/p><p>We need to eliminate any _______ in the hiring process. <em>(elfogults\u00e1g \/ diszkrimin\u00e1ci\u00f3)<\/em><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #22c55e\">elfogults\u00e1g \/ el\u0151\u00edt\u00e9let \/ szeml\u00e9letm\u00f3d \/ ir\u00e1nyults\u00e1g \/ r\u00e9szrehajl\u00e1s<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"background-color: #f3f4f6; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px\">Negative meaning (HU): objektivit\u00e1s \/ p\u00e1rtatlans\u00e1g \/ semlegess\u00e9g<\/span><\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 show _______ = elfogults\u00e1got mutatni (pl. The referee seemed to show _______ towards the home team.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 have a _______ against = elfogults\u00e1ga van valaki\/valami ellen (pl. She felt the teacher had a _______ against her because of her accent.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 unconscious _______ = tudattalan elfogults\u00e1g (pl. Many hiring managers struggle with unconscious _______.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 eliminate _______ = elfogults\u00e1got megsz\u00fcntetni (pl. The company is working to eliminate _______ in its marketing campaigns.)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 political _______ = politikai elfogults\u00e1g (pl. The article was criticized for its obvious political _______.)<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: <strong>bias<\/strong><\/p><p>verb: <strong>bias<\/strong><\/p><p><span style=\"color: #3b82f6\">common pair: show bias \/ have a bias against \/ unconscious bias \/ eliminate bias<\/span><\/p><p>similar: prejudice \/ partiality \/ favoritism \/ leaning<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #ef4444\">negative: impartiality \/ objectivity \/ fairness<\/span><\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"front_to_back","color":"#6366f1","review":{"state":"review","interval":2,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"3 nap","good":"5 nap","easy":"6 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-06T20:54:28+00:00"},{"id":51213,"front":"<p>She wiped the sweat from her ________ after the long run. (homlok)<\/p><p>He placed a cool cloth on his ________ to bring down the fever. (homlok)<\/p><p>The child had a small bruise on her ________ from the fall. (homlok)<\/p><p>She frowned and wrinkles appeared on her ________. (homlok \/ homlokr\u00e1nc)<\/p><p>homlok \/ homlokr\u00e1nc<\/p><p>Negative meaning (HU): tark\u00f3 \/ nyakszirt \/ \u00e1ll<\/p><p>\ud83d\udd11 Tanul\u00e1si megjegyz\u00e9s<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 ________ (noun) = homlok (az arc fels\u0151 r\u00e9sze)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 wipe \/ touch \/ kiss sb&#039;s ________ = megt\u00f6rli \/ meg\u00e9rinti \/ megcs\u00f3kolja valaki homlok\u00e1t<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 slap one&#039;s ________ = a homlok\u00e1ra csap (amikor valami nyilv\u00e1nval\u00f3t vesz \u00e9szre)<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 kiejt\u00e9s: \/\u02c8f\u0252r\u026ad\/ VAGY \/\u02c8f\u0254\u02d0hed\/ \u2014 mindkett\u0151 elfogadott<\/p><p>\ud83d\udc49 high \/ low ________ = magas \/ alacsony homlok<\/p>","front_notes":null,"front_speak":null,"back":"<p>noun: forehead<\/p><p>common pair: wipe one&#039;s forehead \/ kiss on the forehead \/ slap one&#039;s forehead \/ high forehead<\/p><p>similar: brow \/ temple \/ front of the head<\/p><p>negative: back of the head \/ nape \/ chin<\/p>","back_notes":null,"back_speak":null,"study_direction":"back_to_front","color":null,"review":{"state":"review","interval":4,"lapses":0,"is_leech":false},"previews":{"again":"1 perc (\u2192 1 nap)","hard":"5 nap","good":"10 nap","easy":"13 nap"},"other_side_due_at":"2026-05-16T17:43:53+00:00"}]},"url":"\/flashcards\/34\/study","version":"8f4ca32974876a648b2aa33abd3f4aea","sharedProps":["errors","name","auth","sidebarOpen","flash"]}</script><div id="app"></div>